# Paths withheld from AI tool context. Read by Gemini CLI; other agents in this
# repo are scoped by their own config (.claude/, .codex/, opencode.json).
#
# This is not a duplicate of .gitignore. It lists paths that cost context without
# repaying it, including some that are committed (the encrypted secrets) and some
# that are not (vendored collections, build output).

# Encrypted secrets: opaque ciphertext, nothing to read. Values are never to be
# printed anyway (AGENTS.md), so feeding these to a model has no upside.
.env/
**/*.sops.env
**/*.sops.yaml

# Vendored Ansible collections: thousands of upstream files, already gitignored.
ansible/collections/

# Symlinks into separate private repos (homelab-plans / homelab-md). Each has its
# own git history and may be absent on a fresh clone.
docs/plans
docs/md

# Build artifacts, regenerated on demand.
**/charts/*.tgz
**/Chart.lock
packer/downloads/
packer/output-*/
packer/packer_cache/
